CuraEngine @VERSION@ (binary build)
===================================

This archive contains CuraEngine, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0 (see LICENSES/CuraEngine-AGPL-3.0.txt), together with resources
from Ultimaker/Cura (LGPL-3.0) and Ultimaker/fdm_materials (see LICENSES/),
and Intel oneTBB (Apache-2.0, lib/libtbb.so.12).

Corresponding source:
  CuraEngine  https://github.com/Ultimaker/CuraEngine/tree/@VERSION@
              plus LICENSES/curaengine-@VERSION@-portability.patch (build fixes only:
              missing includes and a 32-bit size_t template deduction)
  Cura        https://github.com/Ultimaker/Cura/tree/@VERSION@
  Materials   https://github.com/Ultimaker/fdm_materials/tree/@VERSION@
  Build       https://github.com/technoo10201/OctoPrint-CuraEngine5/tree/main/build
              (Dockerfile.cross, cross-build.sh, cross.profile.in)

This is an unofficial build, not provided or supported by UltiMaker.
